  ('make', '/meɪk/', 'create', 'destroy', 'To form something by putting parts together or by shaping materials.', 'làm, chế tạo', 'She made a cake for my birthday.', '{IELTS}', 'A1', 'Verbs'),
  ('over', '/ˈoʊvər/', 'above', 'under', 'Extending upward from; more than; across.', 'trên, hơn, qua', 'The plane flew over the mountains.', '{IELTS}', 'A1', 'Grammar'),
  ('think', '/θɪŋk/', '[''believe'', ''consider'', ''conceive'', ''opine'', ''suppose'']', '[''forget'', ''unthink'', ''disthink'']', 'To have a particular belief or idea.', 'nghĩ, suy nghĩ', 'I think so.', '{IELTS}', 'A1', 'Verbs'),
  ('any', '/ˈɛni/', 'some', 'none', 'One or some of a thing, no matter how much; used in negatives and questions.', 'bất kỳ, chút nào', 'Do you have any questions?', '{IELTS}', 'A1', 'Grammar'),
  ('then', '/ðɛn/', 'next', 'now', 'At that time; next in sequence; in that case.', 'sau đó, lúc đó', 'Finish your work and then we can play.', '{IELTS}', 'A1', 'Grammar'),
  ('back', '/bæk/', 'spine', 'front', 'The rear surface of the body from shoulders to hips.', 'lưng', 'He has a pain in his lower back.', '{IELTS}', 'A1', 'Body'),
