  ('add', '/æd/', '[''include'', ''append'', ''attach'', ''insert'', ''supplement'']', '[''subtract'', ''remove'', ''delete'', ''deduct'', ''eliminate'']', 'to join something to something else so as to increase the size, number, or amount.', 'thêm, cộng', 'Please add some sugar to my tea.', '{IELTS}', 'A1', 'Verbs'),
