  ('identity', '/aɪˈdentɪti/', '[''individuality'', ''personal identity'', ''identity element'', ''identity operator'', ''identicalness'']', '[''commonality'', ''nonidentity'', ''unidentity'']', 'the fact of being who or what a person or thing is', 'danh tính, bản sắc', 'The police are trying to establish the victim''s identity.', '{IELTS}', 'B1', 'Abstract'),
