  ('jettison', '/ˈdʒetɪsn/', '[''discard'']', '[''retain'', ''unjettison'', ''disjettison'']', 'to throw or drop something from an aircraft or ship', 'ném xuống, loại bỏ', 'The crew had to jettison the cargo to save the sinking ship.', '{IELTS}', 'C2', 'Verbs'),
